<fieldset><legend>Sources for this selector</legend><p>{applicable.length} compatible source definitions · {selectedSources.filter(id=>applicable.some(s=>s.id===id)).length} selected. Browser workflows do not count as automated checks. Filters change visibility; selected sources remain selected and appear in the request review.</p><label>Source category<select bind:value={sourceCategory}><option value="">All categories</option>{#each [...new Set(applicable.map(s=>s.category))] as c}<option>{c}</option>{/each}</select></label><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" bind:checked={sourceFavoritesOnly}/>Favorite sources only</label><label>Request cost class<select bind:value={billing}><option value="all">All sources</option><option value="free">Native/public sources</option><option value="paid">Optional paid provider</option><option value="manual">Browser · pricing set by provider</option></select></label><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" bind:checked={readyOnly}/>Capable of automated requests</label>{#each filteredSources as s}<label class="source-row"><input type="checkbox" bind:group={selectedSources} value={s.id} disabled={s.delivery!=='native'&&!(s.delivery==='provider_backed'&&configured[s.id])}/><span><strong>{s.title}</strong><small>{s.delivery.replaceAll('_',' ')} · {s.health}</small><small>{s.limitation}</small></span></label><button disabled={pending} aria-pressed={sourceFavorites.includes(s.id)} onclick={()=>{sourceFavorites=sourceFavorites.includes(s.id)?sourceFavorites.filter(id=>id!==s.id):[...sourceFavorites,s.id];void savePrefs();}}>{sourceFavorites.includes(s.id)?'Unfavorite source':'Favorite source'}</button><details class="source-method"><summary>{s.title} methodology and limits</summary><p>{s.cache_max_age_seconds?`Definitive answers can be reused for up to ${s.cache_max_age_seconds/3600} hours. Unknown, blocked and error outcomes are checked again.`:'Answers from this source are not reused automatically.'}</p><p>{s.max_calls} maximum request(s) per selector · {s.max_response_bytes} response bytes. Catalog listings are separate from these reviewed source definitions.</p>{#if s.profile_rule}<dl><dt>Profile URL pattern</dt><dd><code>{s.profile_rule.public_template}</code></dd><dt>Syntax</dt><dd>{s.profile_rule.syntax}</dd><dt>Classification recipe · revision {s.profile_rule.revision}</dt><dd>{s.profile_rule.methodology}</dd></dl><p>Redirected responses, unexpected text and unrelated identities stay Unknown. Challenges and rate limits are Blocked. Missing profiles do not establish registration availability.</p>{/if}</details>{#if s.delivery==='provider_backed'}<button disabled={pending} onclick={()=>providerStatus(s.id)}>Check {s.title} credential</button>{:else if s.delivery==='manual_workflow'}<button onclick={()=>api.researchBrowser(s.id).catch(fail)}>Open {s.title} in browser</button><small>Import a downloaded report, screenshot or source page through Evidence. No query or image is sent by this handoff.</small>{/if}{/each}{#if !applicable.some(s=>s.delivery==='native')}<p>No native account-discovery source is configured for this selector. Formatting validation is separate from account discovery. Use the existing case search or a manual provider workflow.</p>{/if}</fieldset>
