  {#if kind==='image'}<p>The selected artifact's original image bytes are uploaded. Prepare a cropped derivative locally before selecting it if needed.</p><label>Image category<select bind:value={options.image_category}>{#each ['duplicates','landmarks','similar','related'] as c}<option>{c}</option>{/each}</select></label><label>Result page · each page is billed<input type="number" min="1" max="500" bind:value={options.page}/></label><label>Domain filter<input bind:value={options.domain_filter} placeholder="Optional exact domain"/></label><label>Sort<select bind:value={options.sort_type}>{#each ['QUALITY_DESCENDING','QUALITY_ASCENDING','DATE_DESCENDING','DATE_ASCENDING'] as sort}<option>{sort}</option>{/each}</select></label>{/if}
