  {#if results}<section aria-label="Research results"><div class="heading"><h3>Results</h3><span>{results.run_total??results.total} saved responses · {results.total} matching</span><button onclick={()=>refreshResults().catch(fail)}>Refresh results</button></div><p>Source findings are leads, not identity proof. Each successful capture opens its source evidence.</p><div class="result-controls" aria-label="Filter all saved responses"><label>Outcome<select bind:value={outcome}>{#each outcomes as o}<option value={o}>{o.replaceAll('_',' ')}{o==='all'?` (${results.run_total??results.total})`:` (${results.outcome_counts?.[o]??0})`}</option>{/each}</select></label><label>Result category<select bind:value={resultCategory} onchange={()=>resultSource=''}><option value="">All categories</option>{#each resultCategories as c}<option>{c}</option>{/each}</select></label><label>Result source<select bind:value={resultSource} onchange={()=>resultCategory=''}><option value="">All sources</option>{#each resultSourceIds as id}<option value={id}>{sources.find(s=>s.id===id)?.title??id} ({results.source_counts[id]})</option>{/each}</select></label></div><p role="status">{resultLoading?'Loading saved responses…':`${results.total} matching responses across the whole run. Counts beside filters describe all saved responses.`}</p><ResearchFilters bind:value={metadataFilter}/><div class="results" aria-busy={resultLoading}>{#each visibleResults as r (r.id)}<article><div class="heading"><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" bind:group={resultSelection} value={r.id}/>Select {r.source}</label><strong>{r.outcome.replaceAll('_',' ')}</strong>{#if r.from_cache}<span>Cached</span>{/if}</div><h4>{r.selector.normalized}</h4>{#if profileSummary(r).name}<p>{profileSummary(r).name}</p>{/if}{#if profileSummary(r).followers!==null}<p>{profileSummary(r).followers} followers reported by the source</p>{/if}{#if registrationDate(r)}<p>Registration reported by RDAP: <time datetime={registrationDate(r)}>{registrationDate(r)}</time></p>{/if}<p class="time">Observed <time datetime={r.observed_utc}>{r.observed_utc}</time> · {ageText(r.observed_utc)}{#if r.from_cache} · reused from captured evidence{/if}</p>{#if r.url&&external(r.url)}<button onclick={()=>api.researchOpenUrl(r.url).catch(fail)}>Open public source in browser</button>{/if}<div class="actions">{#if r.artifact_id}<button onclick={()=>onopen(r.artifact_id!)}>Inspect captured evidence</button>{/if}<button onclick={()=>copy(r.url||r.id)}>Copy {r.url?'source link':'result ID'}</button></div>{#if onCandidate&&r.outcome==='found'&&['github','codeberg','hackernews','rdap'].includes(r.source)}<details><summary>Stage an evidence-linked review</summary><p>These actions fill the existing review form. You choose records and decide what this source supports.</p><div class="actions"><button disabled={pending} onclick={()=>reviewCandidate(r.id,'create_entity')}>Review as a new source record</button><button disabled={pending} onclick={()=>reviewCandidate(r.id,'add_identifier')}>Review identifier on an existing record</button><button disabled={pending} onclick={()=>reviewCandidate(r.id,'relate')}>Review a relationship using this source</button></div></details>{/if}<ResearchCards fields={r.fields} onerror={fail} onreview={onCandidate&&r.source==='osint_industries'?(index,action)=>reviewCandidate(r.id,action,index):undefined}/><details><summary>Source fields and limitations</summary><pre>{JSON.stringify(r.fields,null,2)}</pre><p>{r.limitation}</p></details></article>{/each}{#if !visibleResults.length}<p>No saved responses match these filters. Choose All outcomes or another source.</p>{/if}</div><div class="actions"><button disabled={resultLoading||resultOffset===0} onclick={()=>pageResults(Math.max(0,resultOffset-50))}>Previous responses</button><span>{results.total?resultOffset+1:0}–{Math.min(resultOffset+50,results.total)} of {results.total}</span><button disabled={resultLoading||resultOffset+50>=results.total} onclick={()=>pageResults(resultOffset+50)}>Next responses</button></div>{#if resultSelection.length}<div class="collection-save"><label>Add selected results<select bind:value={collectionTarget}><option value="">New collection</option>{#each collections as c}<option value={c.id}>{c.name}</option>{/each}</select></label>{#if !collectionTarget}<label>Collection name<input bind:value={collectionName} maxlength="120"/></label>{/if}<button disabled={pending||(!collectionTarget&&!collectionName.trim())} onclick={saveCollection}>Save {resultSelection.length} selected</button><label>Result export format<select bind:value={exportFormat}><option value="csv">CSV</option><option value="json">JSON</option></select></label><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" bind:checked={exportConsent}/>I want a plaintext copy of these selected findings.</label><button disabled={pending||!exportConsent} onclick={exportSelected}>Export selected findings</button></div>{/if}</section>{/if}
 {:else if pane==='directory'}
  <section aria-label="Tool directory"><h3>Tool directory</h3><p>{tools.length} catalog entries · MIT catalog by Justin Nordine. Listings describe external tools; they are not installed connectors or verified live health.</p><div class="directory-controls"><label>Search tools<input bind:value={toolQuery} placeholder="Name, description or category"/></label><label>Category<select bind:value={category}><option value="">All categories</option>{#each [...new Set([...categories,...(category?[category]:[])])] as c}<option>{c}</option>{/each}</select></label><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" bind:checked={favoritesOnly}/>Favorites only</label><label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" bind:checked={tree}/>Group by category</label></div><p>{filteredTools.length} matching entries.</p><details><summary>Catalog flags, provenance and contributions</summary><p>API: an API is listed. T: local installation. D: Google dork. R: registration. M: edit the linked URL manually. Flags and catalog status describe the pinned snapshot, not a live health check.</p><p>OSINT Framework by Justin Nordine · MIT · pinned Git blob ff4107ba8904f04588636ccee1f61ef1e7540dbc. Region and NSFW metadata are unknown where absent.</p><button onclick={()=>api.researchOpenUrl('https://github.com/lockfale/OSINT-Framework').catch(fail)}>Open catalog source and contribution guide</button></details><div class="tool-list">{#if tree}<DirectoryTree branch={directoryTree} onselect={showTool} selectedId={toolDetail?.id} expanded={!!toolQuery}/>{:else}{#each shownTools as t,i (t.id)}{#if tree&&(i===0||shownTools[i-1].category!==t.category)}<h4>{t.category}</h4>{/if}<div class="tool-row"><button aria-label={`${stars.includes(t.id)?'Unfavorite':'Favorite'} ${t.name}`} aria-pressed={stars.includes(t.id)} disabled={pending} onclick={()=>{stars=stars.includes(t.id)?stars.filter(id=>id!==t.id):[...stars,t.id];void savePrefs();}}>{stars.includes(t.id)?'Saved':'Save'}</button><button class="tool-name" aria-pressed={toolDetail?.id===t.id} onclick={e=>showTool(t,e.currentTarget)}><strong>{t.name}</strong><small>{t.category}</small></button><span>{t.pricing||'Pricing unknown'}</span></div>{/each}{/if}</div><div class="actions"><button disabled={tree||toolOffset===0} onclick={()=>toolOffset=Math.max(0,toolOffset-50)}>Previous tools</button><span>{filteredTools.length?toolOffset+1:0}–{Math.min(toolOffset+50,filteredTools.length)}</span><button disabled={tree||toolOffset+50>=filteredTools.length} onclick={()=>toolOffset+=50}>Next tools</button></div>
  {#if toolDetail}<section class="tool-detail" aria-label="Tool details" tabindex="-1" bind:this={detailElement}><div class="heading"><h3>{toolDetail.name}</h3><button onclick={closeTool}>Close details</button></div><nav aria-label="Tool category breadcrumbs">{#each toolDetail.category.split(' > ') as crumb,i}<button onclick={()=>category=toolDetail!.category.split(' > ').slice(0,i+1).join(' > ')}>{crumb}</button>{/each}</nav><p>{toolDetail.description||'No description supplied in this catalog snapshot.'}</p><dl>{#each [['Category',toolDetail.category],['Catalog status',toolDetail.status||'unknown'],['Pricing',toolDetail.pricing||'unknown'],['OPSEC mode',toolDetail.opsec||'unknown'],['Region','Not supplied in this catalog snapshot'],['NSFW classification','Not supplied in this catalog snapshot'],['Best for',toolDetail.best_for],['Input',toolDetail.input],['Output',toolDetail.output],['Operational notes',toolDetail.opsec_note]] as [label,value]}{#if value}<dt>{label}</dt><dd>{value}</dd>{/if}{/each}</dl><p>{[toolDetail.api?'API':'',toolDetail.registration?'Registration required':'',toolDetail.local_install?'Local installation':'',toolDetail.google_dork?'Google dork':'',toolDetail.edit_url?'Edit linked URL manually':'',toolDetail.invitation_only?'Invitation required':'',toolDetail.deprecated?'Deprecated':''].filter(Boolean).join(' · ')}</p>{#if external(toolDetail.url)}<button onclick={()=>api.researchOpenUrl(toolDetail!.url).catch(fail)}>Open external tool in browser</button>{:else}<p>Unsupported external URL; no tool is executed.</p>{/if}<label>Private rating<select bind:value={ratings[toolDetail.id]}><option value={0}>Unrated</option>{#each [0.5,1,1.5,2,2.5,3,3.5,4,4.5,5] as n}<option value={n}>{n}</option>{/each}</select></label><label>Private notes<textarea bind:value={notes[toolDetail.id]} maxlength="10000"></textarea></label><label>Issue draft<select bind:value={drafts[toolDetail.id]}><option value="">None</option><option>Dead link</option><option>Paywalled</option><option>Incorrect information</option></select></label><button disabled={pending} onclick={savePrefs}>Save private review</button><p>Reviews and issue drafts stay in this encrypted case. Nothing is submitted to the catalog operator.</p></section>{/if}</section>
 {:else if pane==='history'}
  <section aria-label="Research history"><h3>Run history</h3>{#each runs?.rows??[] as r}<div class="history-row"><button onclick={()=>openRun(r.id)}>{r.plan.selectors.map(s=>s.normalized).join(', ')}</button><span>{r.completed}/{r.expected} · {r.status}</span><time>{r.created_utc}</time></div>{/each}{#if !runs?.rows.length}<p>No research checks have run in this case.</p>{/if}<div class="actions"><button disabled={runOffset===0} onclick={()=>pageRuns(Math.max(0,runOffset-50))}>Previous runs</button><button disabled={!runs||runOffset+50>=runs.total} onclick={()=>pageRuns(runOffset+50)}>Next runs</button></div></section>
 {:else}<section aria-label="Research collections"><h3>Collections</h3><p>Select result cards to create or extend a collection. Archiving preserves its revision history.</p>{#each collections as c}<div class="history-row"><strong>{c.name}</strong><span>{(c.payload.result_ids as string[]).length} result references</span><button onclick={()=>copy(JSON.stringify(c.payload,null,2))}>Copy result references</button><button onclick={()=>archive(c)}>Archive</button></div>{/each}{#if !collections.length}<p>No collections yet.</p>{/if}</section>{/if}
</section>
<style>
 .research{min-width:0}header{margin-bottom:24px}h2{margin:0 0 12px}h3{margin:28px 0 12px}h4{margin:14px 0 8px}p{color:var(--foreground-secondary);line-height:1.6;max-width:75ch}nav,.actions,.heading{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap}nav{border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);padding-bottom:16px;margin-bottom:24px}.current{background:var(--accent-surface);color:var(--foreground)}label{display:grid;gap:8px;font-size:13px}.query-form,.directory-controls,.collection-save,.result-controls{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:16px;align-items:end}.wide{grid-column:1/-1}.toggle{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}.toggle input,.source-row input,.batch-row input{width:auto}input,select,textarea{width:100%;box-sizing:border-box}select{min-height:40px;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius-control,6px);background:var(--surface-panel);color:var(--foreground);font:inherit}label,fieldset,article,.source-row span{min-width:0}button,dd,h4{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.result-controls{margin:20px 0}.tool-detail:focus{outline:2px solid var(--focus);outline-offset:3px}fieldset{margin:24px 0;padding:16px;border:1px solid var(--border)}.source-row{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:start;margin:12px 0}.source-row span{display:grid;gap:5px}small,.time{display:block;color:var(--foreground-secondary);font-size:12px}.disclosure,.tool-detail{margin:24px 0;padding:24px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius-panel);background:var(--surface-panel)}code,pre{overflow-wrap:anywhere;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:12px}article{padding:20px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}.heading h3{margin-right:auto}.results{margin:20px 0}.results .actions{margin:10px 0}.results details{margin-top:12px}.tool-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto minmax(0,1fr) auto;gap:16px;align-items:center;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}.tool-name{text-align:left;background:transparent;border-color:transparent}.tool-name small{margin-top:5px}.history-row{display:flex;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;padding:16px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}.batch-rows{max-height:320px;overflow:auto}.batch-row span,.batch-row small{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.batch-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto minmax(0,1fr) 110px minmax(0,1fr);gap:12px;padding:10px 0}.collection-save{margin-top:24px}dt{font-weight:600;margin-top:12px}dd{margin:6px 0 12px;color:var(--foreground-secondary)}@media(max-width:900px){.query-form,.directory-controls,.collection-save,.result-controls{grid-template-columns:1fr}.tool-row{grid-template-columns:auto minmax(0,1fr)}.tool-row>span{grid-column:2}}
</style>
